COMPLETE TASK LIST — DATASET 5
________________________________________
1. Data Ingestion & Parsing (Schema Discovery)
•	Load raw text files
•	Load JSON lines logs
•	Load nested JSON blobs
•	Parse JSON safely
•	Handle malformed records
•	Detect schema variability
•	Flatten nested fields
•	Preserve raw payloads
•	Validate encoding (UTF-8 issues)
•	Track ingestion errors explicitly
🚨 Dataset 4 trap avoided: there may be no keys yet.
________________________________________
2. Schema Inference & Structural Validation
•	Infer field names dynamically
•	Detect optional vs mandatory fields
•	Detect type instability across records
•	Resolve mixed-type columns
•	Version inferred schemas
•	Schema drift detection
•	Field frequency analysis
•	Structural completeness metrics
________________________________________
3. Text Understanding & Hygiene
•	Language detection
•	Case normalization
•	Unicode normalization
•	Punctuation handling
•	Stopword handling
•	Tokenization strategy comparison
•	Lemmatization vs stemming
•	Noise detection (templated spam)
•	Text length diagnostics
•	Profanity / toxicity flags (diagnostic)
________________________________________
4. Log Semantics & Event Validation
•	Define event taxonomy
•	Validate event ordering
•	Detect missing start/end events
•	Sessionization
•	Latency analysis
•	Duplicate event detection
•	Clock skew correction
•	Client vs server timestamp reconciliation
•	Event sparsity analysis
________________________________________
5. Missing Data in Semi-Structured Context
•	Structural missingness vs absent fields
•	Null vs empty vs undefined
•	Missingness frequency per field
•	Missingness as signal detection
•	Field-presence indicators
•	Imputation feasibility assessment
________________________________________
6. Combining Unstructured with Structured Data
•	Extract join keys from text/logs
•	Validate join feasibility
•	Left joins vs enrichment joins
•	Time-aware joins (as-of)
•	Partial key joins
•	Join failure diagnostics
•	Post-join row inflation checks
________________________________________
7. Outlier Detection (Unstructured)
•	Text length outliers
•	Rare token detection
•	Event burst anomalies
•	Schema anomaly detection
•	Unusual JSON depth detection
________________________________________
8. Statistical Exploration (Derived Features)
•	Token frequency distributions
•	Zipf law verification
•	Vocabulary growth curves
•	Event frequency distributions
•	Session length distributions
•	Co-occurrence analysis
