13. Feature Selection & Dimensionality Reduction
•	Variance thresholding (sparse)
•	Chi-square tests
•	Mutual information
•	L1 regularization
•	Truncated SVD
•	Topic stability checks
________________________________________
14. Target Construction (Often Overlooked)
•	Label extraction from logs
•	Time-aligned target creation
•	No-future-data enforcement
•	Label noise analysis
•	Weak supervision diagnostics
________________________________________
15. Dataset Splitting (Sequence-Aware)
•	Time-based splits
•	Session-based splits
•	User-based splits
•	Leakage detection via memorization
•	Stratification feasibility analysis
________________________________________
16. Modeling & Evaluation
•	Naive baselines (majority / keyword)
•	Linear models on sparse features
•	Tree models on aggregated features
•	Neural models on embeddings
•	Error analysis by text length
•	Drift sensitivity analysis
________________________________________
What This Dataset Teaches That All Others Cannot
•	Schema is probabilistic
•	Missingness can be structural
•	Text cleaning is feature engineering
•	Joins can be inferred, not declared
•	Leakage hides in timestamps inside text
•	Overfitting is dangerously easy

